: "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2767, "output_tokens": 440, "latency_ms": 11082.598199998756, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要在主页面上添加一个文本组件，显示\"欢迎\"。我需要调用manage_graphics工具的create_text动作来完成这个任务。首先需要确认几个参数：page_id、widget_id、position、text。\n\n用户提到了\"主页面\"，但我并不知道具体的page_id。也许默认的主页ID是\"main\"或者\"home\"？不过最好还是先询问用户确切的page_id，或者使用一个常见的默认值。让我想想：作为SCADA助手，我应该先尝试使用合理的默认值，比如\"main_page\"或\"main\"。但为了准确起见，我应该先询问用户。\n\n不过，根据行为准则，如果信息不足，我应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。目前没有查询页面列表的工具，所以我应该向用户确认page_id。同时，我还需要知道widget_id、position等信息。\n\n但是，用户可能期望我使用默认值。我可以先尝试使用常见的page_id如\"main\"，并为widget_id生成一个唯一标识，比如\"text_welcome\"。position可以设置为一个合理的位置，比如[100, 100]。\n\n那么，我将调用manage_graphics的create_text动作，使用以下参数：\n- page_id: \"main\"（假设主页ID是\"main\"）\n- widget_id: \"text_welcome_001\"（生成一个唯一ID）\n- position: [100, 100]（默认位置）\n- text: \"欢迎\"\n- font_size: 14（默认值）\n\n如果页面ID不正确，工具调用会失败，届时再根据错误信息调整。我决定先尝试调用。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3242, "output_tokens": 215, "latency_ms": 6394.207400000596, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "页面 \"main\" 不存在，无法添加文本组件。请提供正确的页面ID（例如 \"home\"、\"page1\" 或其他已存在的页面名称），以便我为您添加\"欢迎\"文本组件。\n\n另外，请问您对组件的位置和样式有特殊要求吗？如果需要指定具体坐标（x, y）或其他样式设置（如字体大小、颜色等），也可以一并告知。", "reasoning": "页面\"main\"不存在。我需要知道实际存在的页面ID。但当前没有列出页面的工具。我可以询问用户具体的页面ID，或者尝试其他常见的页面名称，比如\"home\"或\"page1\"。不过，为了准确起见，我应该向用户确认。\n\n根据行为准则，如果信息不足，我应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。目前没有查询页面列表的工具，所以我需要询问用户。\n\n我将回复用户，说明页面\"main\"未找到，并请提供正确的页面ID。同时，我也可以询问widget_id和位置偏好。让我用中文回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6009, "output_tokens": 655, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 17487.53620000025}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "b811b683-349d-4f0c-ade8-4dd7a35d3e72", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f3599e6ce1c4114f7b734bd09c7cbd978a1dff38881dc1132eaa887bc698f83d", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-004", "text": "在主页面上添加一个文本组件，显示'欢迎'", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:29.564Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:47.258Z", "total_turns": 1, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:29.564Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:47.258Z"}], "tool_calls": [], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce96f177661087f9ab86d524efd537215f5b6cd00506ab99fc00db443f21ff72", "final_hash": "sha256:ce96f177661087f9ab86d524efd537215f5b6cd00506ab99fc00db443f21ff72", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2767, "output_tokens": 644, "latency_ms": 17688.67560000035, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要一些信息来创建文本组件：\n\n1. **页面ID**：您提到的\"主页面\"的页面ID是什么？\n2. **组件ID**：您希望为这个文本组件指定什么唯一标识符（widget_id）？\n3. **位置**：文本应该显示在页面的什么位置？请提供坐标 [x, y]（例如 [100, 50]）。\n\n提供这些信息后，我可以立即为您创建显示\"欢迎\"的文本组件。", "reasoning": "用户想要在主页面上添加一个显示\"欢迎\"的文本组件。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具包括manage_pages、manage_graphics和manage_scripts。\n\n我需要创建一个文本标签，应该使用manage_graphics工具的create_text动作。但首先需要确认主页面是否存在，不过用户没有提供页面ID。我需要知道页面ID才能创建文本组件。\n\n根据行为准则，如果信息不足，应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。但当前没有查询页面列表的工具，只能向用户确认页面ID。\n\n不过，我可以先尝试用manage_graphics创建文本，但需要page_id参数。如果不知道page_id，我可以向用户询问。或者，也许有默认的\"主页面\"ID？用户提到了\"主页面\"，可能意味着存在一个名为\"主页面\"的页面。\n\n让我看看manage_graphics工具的create_text动作：它需要page_id、widget_id、position、text和action。我需要这些信息。用户只提供了文本内容\"欢迎\"，但没有提供页面ID、组件ID、位置等信息。\n\n我应该向用户询问缺少的信息。根据行为准则，若信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。这里没有查询页面列表的工具，所以需要向用户确认。\n\n因此，我需要询问页面ID、组件ID以及位置信息。或者，也许可以假设一个默认的主页面ID？但安全起见，还是询问用户。\n\n让我用中文回复，询问缺少的信息。不过，作为AI助手，我应该尽可能帮助用户。也许我可以假设一些默认值？但最好还是询问用户。\n\n让我回复用户，询问必要的参数：页面ID、组件ID以及位置。或者，也许位置可以有默认值？但最好还是询问。\n\n我将询问：请提供主页面的页面ID，以及您希望文本组件显示的位置（例如坐标x, y）和组件ID（唯一标识符）。\n\n但用户可能不知道页面ID。也许我可以提供默认值？或者，如果主页面是默认页面，也许ID是\"main\"或\"home\"？不确定。\n\n根据当前阶段和行为准则，我需要向用户确认信息。因此，我将询问用户。\n\n另外，我注意到当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，但可用工具中包含manage_graphics。我应该直接使用工具吗？还是先询问？由于信息不足，我应该先询问。\n\n所以，我会回复用户，询问缺失的信息。然后根据回复再决定下一步。\n\n如果用户提供了信息，我将调用manage_graphics的create_text动作。\n\n现在，开始回复。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2767, "output_tokens": 644, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 17693.3140000001}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "817b7459-7750-47dd-8eef-54aac646dc06", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f3599e6ce1c4114f7b734bd09c7cbd978a1dff38881dc1132eaa887bc698f83d", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-005", "text": "对PT101开启历史记录，变化存储模式", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "history"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:47.613Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:27:06.059Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:47.613Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:54.782Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:26:54.782Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:27:06.059Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8364999994228128, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6742999994457932, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 971, "output_tokens": 155, "latency_ms": 7165.0965000008, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先查看当前的点位和历史记录配置情况，确认 PT101 的状态。", "reasoning": "The user wants to enable history recording for point PT101 with a \"change-based\" storage mode. \n\nLet me first check what points are available and what history configurations exist to understand the current state before making any changes.\n\nI need to:\n1. Check if PT101 exists as a point\n2. Check the current history configuration\n\nLet me call both list_points and list_history to get the current state."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1198, "output_tokens": 499, "latency_ms": 11275.73829999892, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据查询结果：\n\n- **PT101** 点位已存在（模拟量类型）\n- 当前历史记录配置为空，尚未配置任何历史记录\n\n---\n\n**遗憾的是**，当前 `manage_history` 工具仅支持以下操作：\n\n| 操作 | 功能 |\n|------|------|\n| `list_history` | 列出已配置的历史记录标签及参数 |\n| `query_history` | 查询某个标签的历史数据窗口（演示用正弦波数据） |\n\n目前 **没有提供「添加/启用历史记录」或「修改存储模式」的操作**，因此无法直接为 PT101 开启变化存储（change-based）模式的历史记录。\n\n---\n\n**建议方案：**\n1. **如需配置历史记录**，可能需要切换到其他配置阶段或使用其他配置工具（如项目配置文件、数据库直接配置等）\n2. **如需查看现有历史数据**，我可以为您查询（前提是该标签已配置历史记录）\n\n请问您是否有其他方式可以配置历史记录，或者需要我协助其他操作？", "reasoning": "The user wants to enable history recording for tag PT101 with change-based storage mode. However, looking at the available tools in the current CONFIG_HISTORY stage, I only have:\n\n- manage_history with actions: list_history, query_history\n\nThese actions only allow listing configured historian tags and querying historical data. There is no action available to add/configure a new historian tag or enable history recording for a specific point.\n\nThe manage_points tool is not available in the current stage, and manage_history doesn't have an \"add\" or \"configure\" action.\n\nSince the current stage's available tools don't support the user's request to enable history recording for PT101, I should inform the user about this limitation. However, I don't see a clear way to switch to a different stage that would have the right tools.\n\nLet me re-read the instructions:\n- 【当前阶段】CONFIG_HISTORY\n- 【可切换的下一阶段】CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\nNone of these stages seem to have a tool for configuring historian settings either. The available tool manage_history only supports list_history and query_history actions.\n\nI should inform the user that the current available tools only support listing and querying history, not configuring/enabling history recording for tags. This functionality doesn't appear to be available in the current toolset."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2169, "output_tokens": 654, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18445.780699999887}, "judge": null}
