 8633.946800000558, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮您为 TI-201 设置 HH 和 LL 报警。首先让我查看一下现有的点位信息，确认 TI-201 是否存在及其类型。", "reasoning": "The user wants to set up alarms for a point called \"TI-201\":\n- HH (High-High) alarm at 100\n- LL (Low-Low) alarm at 10\n- Both with priority \"high\"\n\nFirst, I need to understand the current context:\n- Current stage: ANALYZE_INTENT\n- Current workflow: AlarmConfig, step: discover_points\n- Available tools: manage_pages (list_pages), manage_points (list_points)\n\nThe user wants to configure alarms, which would typically be done with an alarm configuration tool. However, looking at my available tools, I only have:\n1. manage_pages - for HMI page & widget management\n2. manage_points - for creating/updating/deleting/listing SCADA points\n\nNeither of these tools directly configure alarms. The alarm configuration would likely require a tool like \"configure_alarms\" or similar, which is not in my current available tools.\n\nLet me first check if the point \"TI-201\" exists by listing the points. This will help me verify the point exists before proceeding with alarm configuration.\n\nSince the current available tools don't include alarm configuration tools, I should:\n1. First verify the point exists using list_points\n2. Then, if needed, switch to a more appropriate phase (like CONFIG_ALARM) that might have the right tools\n\nLet me first list the points to see if TI-201 exists and understand its type."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2264, "output_tokens": 313, "latency_ms": 6090.35059999951, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "已确认 TI-201 是一个模拟量点位(analog)。现在我来为您创建 HH 和 LL 两个报警。", "reasoning": "现在我进入了 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，可以使用 manage_alarms 工具来配置报警了。\n\n用户要求为 TI-201 设置：\n1. HH (High-High) alarm 在 100，priority = high\n2. LL (Low-Low) alarm 在 10，priority = high\n\n这是一个模拟输入点（analog），我需要使用 create_analog_alarm 来创建报警。\n\n由于两个报警是独立的，我可以同时调用两次 create_analog_alarm。\n\n我需要为每个报警设置唯一的 ID，例如：\n- alarm_TI201_HH\n- alarm_TI201_LL"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3618, "output_tokens": 256, "latency_ms": 5980.490500000087, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "已完成 TI-201 的报警配置，结果如下：\n\n| 报警 ID | 点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 | 状态 |\n|---------|------|------|------|--------|------|\n| alarm_TI201_HH | TI-201 | High-High | 100 | high | ✅ 已创建 |\n| alarm_TI201_LL | TI-201 | Low-Low | 10 | high | ✅ 已创建 |\n\n两个报警均已成功配置并启用。当 TI-201 的值超过 100 或低于 10 时，将触发高优先级报警。\n\n如需调整阈值或死区(deadband)，请随时告知。任务完成！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user has repeated the same message, but I've already completed the alarm configuration task. Both alarms were created successfully:\n1. alarm_TI201_HH - High alarm at 100, priority high\n2. alarm_TI201_LL - Low alarm at 10, priority high\n\nSince the task is complete, I should inform the user and transition to DONE state."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6856, "output_tokens": 932, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 20717.897900000025}, "judge": null}
