{"trace_id": "34acfc20-3be7-4bae-aaeb-6ec18727657e", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f3599e6ce1c4114f7b734bd09c7cbd978a1dff38881dc1132eaa887bc698f83d", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-018", "text": "新建全局脚本，OnEvent触发，写一段逻辑如果PI-201过高则把valve1置位", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "script"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T05:47:50.818Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T05:48:09.186Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "UNKNOWN", "early_terminated": true, "termination_reason": "no finish() call"}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:47:50.818Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:48:07.755Z"}, {"name": "ASK_USER", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T05:48:07.755Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T05:48:09.186Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "PI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "valve1", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8188000010704855, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {"action": "list_scripts"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "scripts": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7119000001694076, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.003300001480965875, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_hash": null, "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1024, "output_tokens": 249, "latency_ms": 7770.9226999995735, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想创建一个全局脚本，触发类型是OnEvent，逻辑是：如果PI-201过高，则将valve1置位。这里有几个关键点需要澄清：\n\n1. \"PI-201过高\"具体是什么意思？是超过某个阈值吗？用户需要定义这个阈值。\n2. \"valve1置位\"是什么意思？是设置为某个值吗？比如设置为1或True？\n3. 用户需要确认PI-201和valve1这两个点位是否已经存在，或者是否需要创建。\n\n当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，可用工具只有list_scripts和list_points。我需要先了解现有的点位和脚本情况。\n\n首先，我需要调用list_points来查看PI-201和valve1这两个点位是否存在。同时，也可以调用list_scripts来了解现有脚本情况，尽管这可能不是必需的。\n\n让我先调用这两个工具。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3107, "output_tokens": 382, "latency_ms": 9157.43890000158, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "为了创建您需要的脚本，我需要确认几个关键信息：\n\n1. **PI-201的阈值**：您提到\"PI-201过高\"，具体阈值是多少？例如：当PI-201 > 100时？\n2. **valve1的置位操作**：您说\"把valve1置位\"，是设置为1（True）还是其他特定值？\n3. **脚本ID和名称**：您希望为这个脚本指定什么ID和名称？例如：id=\"valve_control_script\"，名称=\"PI-201超限阀门控制\"\n\n另外，我注意到PI-201是模拟量点位，valve1是数字量点位，这些都已经存在。\n\n请提供上述信息，我将为您创建相应的OnEvent触发脚本。\n\nnext_state: ASK_USER", "reasoning": "很好，点位已经存在：\n- PI-201：类型为analog（模拟量）\n- valve1：类型为digital（数字量）\n\n用户提到\"PI-201过高\"，这需要定义一个阈值。作为助手，我应该询问用户具体的阈值是多少。同时，\"valve1置位\"意味着将valve1设置为1或True，但需要确认这一点。\n\n然而，根据工作流程，我可能需要先创建脚本。但用户没有提供完整的脚本逻辑细节。根据行为准则，如果信息不足，我应该先向用户确认。\n\n另外，我注意到当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，我可以切换到ASK_USER阶段来获取更多信息。但根据指令，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换阶段。\n\n让我先向用户询问缺失的信息，然后根据回复决定下一步。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ScriptConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4131, "output_tokens": 631, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 18368.533099999695}, "judge": null}
