）\n\n2. **或者**，如果你有现成的点位配置清单，可以提供给我，我来帮你批量创建。\n\n创建点位后，我们就可以：\n1. ✅ 创建 Trend Page\n2. ✅ 添加 Trend Chart 控件\n3. ✅ 绑定点位历史数据", "reasoning": "The project currently has no pages and no points. This is a problem - without any points, there's nothing to bind to a trend chart.\n\nI need to ask the user:\n1. What points/tags they want to use for the trend chart\n2. Or if they want to configure points first\n\nSince we're in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage and the project is empty, I should inform the user about this situation and ask for more information about what they want to track in the trend chart."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4191, "output_tokens": 541, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 15421.734699999433}, "judge": null}
