nage_points，这些工具似乎存在但参数不对。\n\n让我重新查看系统提示中的当前可用工具部分：\"当前可用工具: (仅以下工具可被调用) - deployment: Project validation, deployment, rollback, status.; 当前允许 actions: deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment\"\n\n这说明在 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，只有 deployment 工具可用。但我之前尝试了 manage_pages 和 manage_points，这些工具在当前阶段应该不可用。\n\n用户要求：\"建一个反应釜综合监控方案：新建画面，建三个点位（温度、压力、液位），绑到画面的罐子和仪表上，最后下发验证\"\n\n这是一个完整的配置任务，需要多个工具：创建页面、创建点位、绑定点位到小部件、验证、部署。但当前阶段只有 deployment 工具可用。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：\"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\n我需要切换到能使用其他工具的阶段。查看可切换的下一阶段：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n其中：\n- MANAGE_PAGES：可能用于创建页面\n- CONFIG_POINT：可能用于创建点位\n- BIND_POINTS：可能用于绑定\n- DEPLOY：用于部署\n- VALIDATE：用于验证\n\n我需要按顺序完成这些任务。但首先，我应该切换到能创建页面的阶段。可能是 MANAGE_PAGES。\n\n让我先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。"}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5094, "output_tokens": 140, "latency_ms": 5465.345200000229, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要了解MANAGE_PAGES阶段的可用工具。系统提示说\"当前可用工具: (仅以下工具可被调用)\"，但没有列出具体工具。从之前的错误信息来看，我尝试了manage_pages和manage_points，但都报错了。可能这些工具在这个阶段是可用的，但参数格式不对。\n\n让我先尝试查看当前有哪些页面和点位，使用list操作。之前在VALIDATE阶段使用list_pages和list_points是成功的。现在在MANAGE_PAGES阶段，应该也有这些工具。先尝试list_pages。"}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5312, "output_tokens": 134, "latency_ms": 5543.5913000001165, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在有一个页面\"reactor_monitoring\"。接下来需要创建三个点位：温度、压力、液位。需要调用manage_points工具来创建点位。之前的尝试中，manage_points的create_point操作需要tag和type字段。让我尝试正确的字段名。\n\n首先检查manage_points工具的定义：它应该有create_point操作。从之前的错误信息看，需要tag和type字段。尝试使用正确的字段。"}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5518, "output_tokens": 122, "latency_ms": 5237.645100000009, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要创建三个点位：温度、压力、液位。根据错误信息，type 应该是 'analog', 'digital' 或 'string'。温度、压力、液位都是模拟量，应该用 'analog'。现在我来创建这三个点位。先创建温度点位。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 42686, "output_tokens": 3807, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 127560.52180000006}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "b8211848-940c-4925-9a45-141116a0898b", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f3599e6ce1c4114f7b734bd09c7cbd978a1dff38881dc1132eaa887bc698f83d", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-027", "text": "批量生成PT-100到PT-110这11个点，全配上H和HH报警，并且统统挂到历史库里存储模式设为周期，1秒一次", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "point"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T06:01:35.043Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T06:02:10.527Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:01:35.043Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:01:46.802Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:01:46.802Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:02:10.527Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7838999990781303, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 988, "output_tokens": 449, "latency_ms": 11753.514900001392, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来分析一下您的需求。您需要：\n1. **创建** PT-100 到 PT-110 共 11 个点位\n2. **配置** H（高报）和 HH（高高报）报警\n3. **配置** 历史库存储，周期模式，1秒采样\n\n当前我处于 **ANALYZE_INTENT** 阶段，可用工具仅有查询类功能。让我先查一下现有项目的状态，确认这些点位是否已存在：", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Create 11 points: PT-100 through PT-110\n2. Configure H (High) and HH (High-High) alarms for each\n3. Configure history storage with periodic mode at 1-second intervals\n\nLet me analyze what I can do with the current available tools:\n- `manage_points`: Currently only allows `list_points` action\n- `manage_pages`: Currently only allows `list_pages` action\n\nI cannot create points, configure alarms, or configure history with the current available tools. \n\nLooking at the workflow context:\n- Current workflow: AlarmConfig\n- Current step: discover_points\n- Current stage: ANALYZE_INTENT\n\nThe available next stages are: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nTo accomplish what the user wants, I need:\n1. CONFIG_POINT - to create the PT-100 to PT-110 points\n2. CONFIG_ALARM - to configure H and HH alarms\n3. CONFIG_HISTORY - to configure history storage\n\nBut first, I should check what points already exist. Let me call list_points to see the current state, and then I'll need to switch to appropriate stages to perform the actual configuration.\n\nLet me first query the existing points to understand the current state, then explain to the user that I need to switch stages to perform the creation and configuration."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2328, "output_tokens": 877, "latency_ms": 23720.7197000007, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我现在处于 **CONFIG_ALARM** 阶段。但我需要先向您说明一个关键问题：\n\n## ⚠️ 前置条件不满足\n\n刚才查询结果显示，项目中 **当前没有任何点位**（0个点）。您的需求涉及三步：\n\n| 步骤 | 内容 | 所需阶段 | 状态 |\n|------|------|----------|------|\n| ① 创建 PT-100 ~ PT-110（11个模拟量点） | `CONFIG_POINT` | ❌ 未执行 |\n| ② 配置 H / HH 报警 | `CONFIG_ALARM`（当前阶段） | ⏳ 等待点位创建 |\n| ③ 配置历史库（周期1秒） | `CONFIG_HISTORY` | ⏳ 未到达 |\n\n**问题**：报警必须绑定到已存在的点位上。如果点位 PT-100 ~ PT-110 不存在，我无法为它们创建报警（创建会失败或无效）。\n\n## 建议操作顺序\n\n1. 先切换到 **`CONFIG_POINT`** 阶段，创建 PT-100 到 PT-110 共 11 个模拟量点\n2. 再回到 **`CONFIG_ALARM`** 阶段，为每个点创建 H 和 HH 报警\n3. 最后切换到 **`CONFIG_HISTORY`** 阶段，配置历史存储\n\n---\n\n请问是否先切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 阶段来创建这 11 个点位？如果这些点位已经在其他系统中存在（只是未导入），请告诉我具体情况。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "The user has told me I'm now in the CONFIG_ALARM stage. Let me check what tools are available in this stage.\n\nCurrent available tools:\n- manage_alarms: actions include set_threshold, create_digital_alarm, disable_alarm, delete_alarm, enable_alarm, create_analog_alarm\n- manage_points: action list_points only\n\nThe problem is:\n1. The user wants to create PT-100 to PT-110 points - but I don't have a tool to create points in this stage\n2. The user wants H and HH alarms - I can do this with create_analog_alarm, but only on existing analog points\n3. The user wants history configuration - I don't have history management tools\n\nSo the issue is that:\n- Points don't exist yet (we confirmed 0 points)\n- I can't create points in CONFIG_ALARM stage\n- I can't configure history in CONFIG_ALARM stage\n\nFor the alarm creation, I need existing points to attach alarms to. Since the points don't exist yet, I should inform the user that we need to first create the points (CONFIG_POINT stage) before we can configure alarms.\n\nHowever, the user explicitly told me I'm in CONFIG_ALARM stage. Let me think about this more carefully.\n\nLooking at my behavior guidelines:\n- Rule 5: If current stage tools don't meet requirements, I can switch stages by including \"next_state: stage_name\" in my response\n\nThe user wants:\n1. Create 11 points (PT-100 to PT-110) - needs CONFIG_POINT stage\n2. Configure H and HH alarms - can do in CONFIG_ALARM with manage_alarms create_analog_alarm\n3. Configure history storage - needs CONFIG_HISTORY stage\n\nSince I'm in CONFIG_ALARM but the points don't exist yet, I need to:\n1. Explain that we need to create the points first\n2. Suggest switching to CONFIG_POINT stage\n\nBut wait - the user explicitly said \"你已进入 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段\" - they want me to work in this stage. \n\nThe core issue is that the prerequisite step—creating the points—hasn't happened yet. I can't configure alarms on points that don't exist. I should explain this dependency clearly to the user and suggest we need to go back to the CONFIG_POINT stage first to create the PT-100 through PT-110 points before proceeding with alarm configuration."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3316, "output_tokens": 1326, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 35484.06630000136}, "judge": null}
