"mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 227, "latency_ms": 6098.503100000016, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个泵站控制台，包括启停控制功能，并且还要配置报警。这是一个综合性的请求，需要多个步骤来完成。\n\n根据当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要先理解用户的需求。用户提到了\"泵站控制台\"、\"启停控制\"和\"报警\"。这涉及到：\n1. 创建泵站相关的点位（tags）- 包括控制点和状态点\n2. 创建HMI页面用于控制台显示\n3. 配置报警\n\n目前我处于 ANALYZE_INTENT 阶段，可用的工具有：\n- manage_points: 只能执行 list_points 操作\n- manage_pages: 只能执行 list_pages 操作\n\n我需要先了解当前项目中已有的点位和页面情况。让我先调用查询工具来获取现有信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3023, "output_tokens": 487, "latency_ms": 20050.3946000008, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前项目是空的，我来为您创建一套完整的泵站控制系统，包括：\n\n**泵站点位配置：**\n- 泵启动/停止控制（数字输出点）\n- 泵运行状态（数字输入点）\n- 故障信号（数字输入点）\n- 流量/压力监测（模拟输入点）\n\n**报警配置：**\n- 泵故障报警（数字报警）\n- 流量/压力越限报警（模拟报警）\n\n**HMI页面：**\n- 泵站控制台界面\n\n开始配置，先创建点位：\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "项目是空的，没有点位也没有页面。用户想要一个泵站控制台，带启停控制和报警。我需要：\n\n1. 创建泵站相关的点位：\n   - 控制点：启动命令、停止命令（数字量输出）\n   - 状态点：泵运行状态、故障状态（数字量输入）\n   - 过程变量：流量、压力、电流等（模拟量输入）- 可选\n\n2. 创建HMI页面：泵站控制台\n\n3. 配置报警：\n   - 故障报警（数字报警）\n   - 流量/压力越限报警（模拟报警）\n\n但是当前阶段是 ANALYZE_INTENT，可用的工具只有查询类工具（list_points 和 list_pages）。我不能直接创建点位。\n\n我需要切换到其他阶段才能完成这些操作。让我看看可切换的下一阶段：\n- ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n根据用户需求，我需要：\n1. 先创建点位 - 需要切换到 CONFIG_POINT\n2. 创建页面 - 需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES\n3. 配置报警 - 需要切换到 CONFIG_ALARM\n\n但是我现在还不能直接创建点位，因为当前可用工具只有 list_points。我需要在回复中说明我的计划，然后切换到合适的阶段。\n\n让我先向用户确认一下需求细节，然后开始创建。不过用户说\"全套搞定\"，意思应该是一步到位。我应该直接创建一个泵站控制系统。\n\n我现在切换到 CONFIG_POINT 阶段来创建点位。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3524, "output_tokens": 972, "latency_ms": 20486.555299999964, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "现在为泵站创建完整的点位配置：", "reasoning": "用户现在处于 CONFIG_POINT 阶段。让我看看当前可用的工具：\n\n- manage_points: Create / update / delete SCADA point definitions, or view existing point configuration. 当前允许 actions: create_point\n- manage_graphics: delete_widget, create_text\n- manage_scripts: create_script\n- manage_reports: create_report_template\n- manage_alarms: disable_alarm, delete_alarm, enable_alarm, create_digital_alarm, create_analog_alarm\n- manage_pages: create_page\n\n现在我需要为泵站控制系统创建点位。我需要创建：\n\n1. 泵控制点（数字输出）：\n   - PUMP_101_CMD: 启动命令\n   - PUMP_101_STOP: 停止命令\n\n2. 泵状态点（数字输入）：\n   - PUMP_101_RUN: 运行状态\n   - PUMP_101_FAULT: 故障状态\n\n3. 过程变量（模拟输入）：\n   - FLOW_101: 流量\n   - PRESS_101: 压力\n\n让我开始创建这些点位。我可以同时创建多个点位，因为它们之间没有依赖关系。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4747, "output_tokens": 659, "latency_ms": 15285.902300000089, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "参数名需要调整，让我重新创建泵站点位：", "reasoning": "我需要查看正确的参数。根据错误信息，需要 `tag` 和 `type` 字段，而不是 `id` 和 `data_type`。让我重新创建点位。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5657, "output_tokens": 657, "latency_ms": 15706.890400000702, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我重新尝试创建点位，先创建第一个测试：", "reasoning": "The user is telling me I'm in CONFIG_POINT stage. Let me re-read the function schema more carefully.\n\nLooking at the manage_points function:\n```json\n{\n  \"description\": \"Create / update / delete SCADA point definitions, or view existing point configuration.\\nCurrently allowed actions:\\n- create_point: Register a new SCADA point (tag) with its metadata.\",\n  \"name\": \"manage_points\",\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"oneOf\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"title\": \"create_point\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"const\": \"create_point\"},\n          \"name\": {\"title\": \"Name\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"tag\": {\"description\": \"Unique point identifier, e.g. 'TEMP_101'\", \"title\": \"Tag\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"type\": {\"description\": \"Data type: bool, int, float, string, enum\", \"enum\": [\"bool\", \"int\", \"float\", \"string\", \"enum\"], \"title\": \"Type\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"address\": {\"title\": \"Address\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"unit\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Unit\"},\n          \"min_value\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Min Value\"},\n          \"max_value\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"number\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Max Value\"},\n          \"description\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Description\"},\n          \"category\": {\"anyOf\": [{\"type\": \"string\"}, {\"type\": \"null\"}], \"default\": null, \"title\": \"Category\"}\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"tag\", \"type\", \"name\", \"address\", \"action\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"strict\": false\n}\n```\n\nSo the required fields are: tag, type, name, address, action.\n\nMy parameters were:\n- action: \"create_point\"\n- tag: \"PUMP_101_CMD\"\n- type: \"bool\"\n- name: \"1号泵启动命令\"\n- address: \"DO.1\"\n\nThese all look correct. Let me try again. Maybe there was a formatting issue with my calls? Let me try with a single point first."}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6380, "output_tokens": 364, "latency_ms": 14308.393299999807, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我尝试用更简单的方式调用：", "reasoning": "I'm still getting the same error. The error says \"create_point.tag: Field required; create_point.type: Field required\" even though I'm providing those fields. \n\nLet me look at the tool schema more carefully. The function is called `manage_points` and it has a `oneOf` with `create_point` action. But wait - I notice that in the current stage context, it says the tool is `manage_points` with allowed action `create_point`.\n\nBut looking at the error, it seems like the parameters might not be passing through correctly. Let me check if maybe I need to use a different structure. The schema shows:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create_point\",\n  \"tag\": \"...\",\n  \"type\": \"...\",\n  \"name\": \"...\",\n  \"address\": \"...\"\n}\n```\n\nThese are all flat properties at the object level. Let me try again, maybe with simpler values or a different approach.\n\nWait, I should check if maybe there's an issue with how I'm calling the function. Let me look at the function definition again:\n\nThe function is `manage_points` and it takes a `oneOf` with the create_point schema. The required fields are:\n- tag\n- type\n- name\n- address\n- action\n\nI've provided all of these. Let me try with simpler ASCII values to see if that helps."}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6810, "output_tokens": 509, "latency_ms": 12847.589299999527, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "让我尝试最小化参数调用：", "reasoning": "I'm still getting the same error. Let me check the function schema again more carefully. The function is `manage_points` with `oneOf` containing `create_point`. \n\nLooking at the schema:\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"const\": \"create_point\"},\n  \"tag\": {\"description\": \"Unique point identifier, e.g. 'TEMP_101'\", \"title\": \"Tag\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n  \"type\": {\"description\": \"Data type: bool, int, float, string, enum\", \"enum\": [\"bool\", \"int\", \"float\", \"string\", \"enum\"], \"title\": \"Type\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n  \"name\": {\"title\": \"Name\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n  \"address\": {\"title\": \"Address\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields are: [\"tag\", \"type\", \"name\", \"address\", \"action\"]\n\nI'm providing all of these. But the error says \"create_point.tag: Field required; create_point.type: Field required\"\n\nWait - maybe the issue is that when I use `manage_points`, the parameters need to be structured differently? Let me check if there's something about how the tool accepts parameters.\n\nActually, looking at the available tools in the system prompt again:\n\n```\n【当前可用工具