el页面画一个罐体，并将液位、温度、压力分别绑定到LT_01、TT_01、PT_01。\n\n首先，我需要确认这些点位是否存在。调用manage_points的list_points来查看所有点位。然后，我需要绑定这些点位。但是，用户提到\"画一个罐体\"，这意味着需要创建一个罐体小部件。然而，当前的manage_pages工具只支持bind_point和list_pages，没有创建小部件的功能。这可能意味着小部件已经存在，或者需要在其他阶段创建。不过，既然用户进入了BIND_POINTS阶段，可能小部件已经创建好了，只需要绑定点位。\n\n因此，我应该先列出页面，确认chem_panel页面存在。然后列出点位，确认LT_01、TT_01、PT_01存在。之后，再执行绑定操作。但绑定需要指定widget_id和property。用户没有提供这些信息。可能需要假设小部件已经存在，并且有默认的widget_id和property。或者，也许需要向用户询问这些信息。\n\n根据行为准则，如果信息不足，应先调用查询工具或向用户确认。所以，我应该先列出点位，然后向用户询问具体的widget_id和property。或者，也许有默认的命名约定？例如，罐体小部件可能名为\"tank_01\"，属性为\"level\"、\"temperature\"、\"pressure\"。但这只是猜测。\n\n让我先列出点位。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4116, "output_tokens": 808, "latency_ms": 26532.347700000173, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要更多信息来完成点位绑定。目前处于 BIND_POINTS 阶段，我可以为现有组件绑定点位，但需要知道：\n\n1. **罐体组件的 Widget ID**：您希望绑定到哪个罐体组件？如果还没有创建罐体组件，需要先进入其他阶段创建（当前阶段只能绑定，不能创建）。\n\n2. **绑定属性**：液位、温度、压力分别对应组件的哪些属性？常见的属性名可能是 `level`、`temperature`、`pressure`，但具体取决于组件定义。\n\n请提供：\n- 罐体的 Widget ID（例如 \"tank_01\"）\n- 每个点位对应的属性名称\n\n如果罐体组件尚未创建，请告知是否需要切换到可以创建组件的阶段。", "reasoning": "用户要求在chem_panel页面画一个罐体，并绑定LT_01、TT_01、PT_01这三个点位。当前阶段是BIND_POINTS，可用工具包括manage_pages（bind_point, list_pages）和manage_points（list_points）。我需要先确认chem_panel页面是否存在，然后创建一个罐体widget（可能需要create_widget），但当前阶段没有create_widget功能。不过，用户明确说“画一个罐体”，这可能意味着需要创建widget。但根据工具描述，manage_pages在BIND_POINTS阶段只允许bind_point和list_pages。所以可能需要切换到其他阶段来创建widget。但用户说“请使用当前可用工具继续完成任务”，这暗示我应该使用当前可用的工具。也许罐体widget已经存在了？让我先列出页面，看看chem_panel页面上有哪些widget。使用manage_pages的list_pages？等等，list_pages只是列出页面，不会列出widget。实际上，list_pages可能只返回页面列表，不包含widget信息。不过，让我先调用一下看看。之前调用过list_pages，显示有chem_panel页面。但需要知道widget信息。也许有另一个工具可以列出widget？但当前没有这样的工具。可能用户期望我直接绑定点位到现有的widget。但用户说“画一个罐体”，这暗示需要创建一个罐体widget。也许在BIND_POINTS阶段，我可以先绑定点位，假设widget已经存在。但为了确保，我应该询问用户widget ID。不过，让我先尝试绑定点位。但需要widget_id和property。我可以假设widget_id是\"tank_01\"，属性是\"level\"、\"temperature\"、\"pressure\"。但这只是猜测。更好的做法是询问用户具体的widget ID和属性。或者，也许系统有默认的命名约定。让我先尝试绑定LT_01到某个widget的level属性。但不知道widget_id。看来需要更多信息。根据行为准则，若信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。我可以询问用户widget ID和属性。或者，也许我可以创建一个罐体widget？但当前阶段没有create_widget。不过，manage_pages工具描述中确实有create_widget功能，但当前允许的actions只有bind_point和list_pages。这可能意味着create_widget在当前阶段被禁用了。所以，我只能绑定已有的widget。因此，我需要向用户确认widget ID和属性。让我用自然语言询问。但用户可能期望我自动完成。也许系统中有默认的罐体widget，比如\"tank_widget\"或类似。让我尝试使用常见的名称，如\"tank_01\"，属性如\"level\"、\"temperature\"、\"pressure\"。但为了安全起见，我应该先询问。我将回复用户，请求提供widget ID和属性信息。同时，我可以说明当前阶段可以绑定点位，但需要这些信息。另外，也许我可以先绑定LT_01到一个假设的widget，如果失败再询问。但根据行为准则，我应该避免盲目操作。所以，我将询问用户。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 6572, "output_tokens": 1427, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 47371.384500000204}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "c913c993-d53c-49a3-86cf-a05f45c6a85a", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f3599e6ce1c4114f7b734bd09c7cbd978a1dff38881dc1132eaa887bc698f83d", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-048", "text": "把source_page上的valve1复制到target_page，位置改到[300,120]，绑定保持VALVE_1_OPEN", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T06:22:20.739Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T06:22:57.854Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:22:20.740Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:22:57.854Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "pages": [{"id": "source_page", "name": "源"}, {"id": "target_page", "name": "目标"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4138999995338963, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "VALVE_1_OPEN", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.2081999993824866, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.007300001016119495, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_hash": "sha256:7b43db343cffd07978023e26ab54e6ff7dfe5e021eb5c4600f9a701c0b5baa03", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 978, "output_tokens": 437, "latency_ms": 14343.061500001568, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查询一下当前的页面和点位信息，确认相关资源是否存在。", "reasoning": "The user wants to copy a widget called \"valve1\" from \"source_page\" to \"target_page\", change its position to [300, 120], and keep the point binding to \"VALVE_1_OPEN\".\n\nLooking at my current available tools and the current stage:\n- Current stage: ANALYZE_INTENT\n- Available tools: manage_points (list_points action only), manage_pages (list_pages action only)\n\nThe user's request involves:\n1. Copying a widget from one page to another\n2. Changing position\n3. Keeping point binding\n\nHowever, my current tools only support:\n- list_points: listing SCADA points\n- list_pages: listing HMI pages\n\nI don't have tools available to:\n- Copy/move widgets between pages\n- Modify widget positions\n- Set widget bindings\n\nThe workflow context says: current workflow=PointBinding, step=list_targets\n\nThis seems to be related to point-widget binding configuration. But the user's actual request is about copying a widget with a specific position and binding.\n\nLet me first gather information by listing pages and points to understand the current state, then I need to switch to a more appropriate phase that can handle widget operations.\n\nActually, looking at the available tools more carefully:\n- manage_pages mentions \"HMI page & widget management, including point↔widget binding\" but currently only allows \"list_pages\"\n- manage_points only allows \"list_points\"\n\nSo I cannot perform the copy/move/binding operations with the current tools. I need to either:\n1. First list pages and points to verify they exist\n2. Then switch to a different phase that allows widget operations (like BIND_POINTS or MANAGE_PAGES with more actions available)\n\nLet me first call the list tools to get the current state, then inform the user about what's needed."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3482, "output_tokens": 786, "latency_ms": 22755.41390000035, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **信息确认：**\n- **source_page** 和 **target_page** 两个页面均已存在\n- 点位 **VALVE_1_OPEN**（digital 类型）已存在\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **功能限制说明：**\n\n根据我当前可用的工具，我**无法**完成以下操作：\n1. **复制/创建 widget** — 当前工具不支持跨页面复制控件\n2. **修改 widget 位置** — 当前工具不支持设置 widget 坐标\n\n我**可以**完成的操作：\n- ✅ **绑定点位到 widget** — 在 BIND_POINTS 阶段，我可以将 `VALVE_1_OPEN` 绑定到目标页面上某个 widget 的属性\n\n---\n\n**建议方案：**\n\n请您先在 **target_page** 上手动创建 valve1 widget（位置 [300, 120]），创建完成后告诉我该 widget 的 **widget_id**，我就可以帮您完成 `VALVE_1_OPEN` 点位绑定。\n\n或者，如果 target_page 上已经有一个 valve1 widget，请提供它的 widget_id，我立即为您绑定。\n\n需要我先切换到 BIND_POINTS 阶段准备绑定吗？", "reasoning": "Good, I found:\n- Pages: source_page and target_page both exist\n- Points: VALVE_1_OPEN exists (digital type)\n\nNow, the user wants to:\n1. Copy valve1 widget from source_page to target_page\n2. Set position to [300, 120]\n3. Keep binding to VALVE_1_OPEN\n\nHowever, my current available tools (manage_pages with only list_pages action) don't support:\n- Widget copying/creation\n- Position changes\n- Only the BIND_POINTS phase allows bind_point action\n\nLooking at the workflow context: \"current workflow=PointBinding, step=list_targets\" and \"BIND_POINTS\" is listed as a valid next_state.\n\nThe current phase \"ANALYZE_INTENT\" with only list capabilities cannot fulfill this request. I need to switch to the \"BIND_POINTS\" phase which allows the bind_point action.\n\nBut even bind_point only allows binding a point to a widget property - it doesn't handle widget creation/copying or position changes.\n\nActually, let me re-read the user's request. They want to:\n1. Copy a widget (this requires widget management beyond my current tools)\n2. Change position (also beyond my current tools)\n3. Keep binding\n\nThe available tools across all phases seem to be:\n- manage_pages: bind_point (in BIND_POINTS phase)\n- manage_alarms: set_threshold\n- manage_scripts: update_script_body\n- manage_history: enable_history, list_history, set_retention\n- manage_schedules: get_schedule_status\n- manage_points: update_point\n- manage_devices: update_device\n- manage_reports: export_report\n\nNone of these support widget creation/copying or position changes. The bind_point action only binds a point to an existing widget's property.\n\nI should inform the user that:\n1. The pages and point exist\n2. I can help with the binding part by switching to BIND_POINTS phase\n3. But widget copying and position changes are not supported by my current toolset\n\nLet me explain this to the user and offer to proceed with what I can do (binding), or suggest they need additional tools for widget management.\n\n\nLooking at the manage_pages tool description more carefully, it handles HMI page and widget management with point-widget binding. The bind_point action takes page_id, widget_id, property, and tag parameters—this suggests the widget must already exist on the target page. I need to clarify with the user whether valve1 is already present on target_page or if they need to create it first, since my current capabilities can only bind points to existing widgets."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 4460, "output_tokens": 1223, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 37114.33399999987}, "judge": null}
