建 tank widget。使用 widget_id: \"tank1\", widget_type: \"tank\", title: \"Tank\", position: [100, 100], expected_binding_types: {\"value\": [\"TI-201\"]}。但工具参数中确实写的是 widget_type，但错误说 type 字段必需。也许实际 API 接受的是 type？让我尝试使用 type 而不是 widget_type。另外，page_id 是必需的。我会提供 page_id: \"chem_screen\"。现在尝试调用。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6375, "output_tokens": 542, "latency_ms": 13901.949699997203, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我需要切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段来创建 tank 和 button widget。当前 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段无法创建 widget。\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**\n\n切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段后，我将为您创建：\n1. Tank widget 绑定到 TI-201\n2. Start button 绑定到 CMD_START\n\n请稍候...", "reasoning": "系统反复在 MANAGE_PAGES 和 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段之间切换。用户需要创建 tank 和 button，但当前 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段无法创建 widget。根据行为准则，我需要切换到合适的阶段。用户需求是创建 widget 和绑定点位，这应该在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段完成。但之前尝试调用 create_widget 时出现 schema 错误。让我重新检查工具定义。\n\n查看 manage_pages 工具定义：它有一个 oneOf 结构，包含 create_widget、create_page、list_pages 三种动作。create_widget 的 properties 包括：action, page_id, widget_id, widget_type, title, position, expected_binding_types。其中 position 类型是 array，描述说是 [x, y] 数组。required 字段是 page_id, widget_id, widget_type, position, expected_binding_types。\n\n我之前的调用用了 \"type\" 而不是 \"widget_type\"，这就是错误原因。应该使用 \"widget_type\"。另外 position 应该是数组 [x, y]。我需要提供 page_id（chem_screen），widget_id（如 \"tank1\"），widget_type（\"tank\"），title（可选），position（[100, 100]），expected_binding_types（{\"value\": [\"TI-201\"]}）。\n\n但现在系统处于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，我需要先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。我将在回复中包含 next_state: MANAGE_PAGES。然后在该阶段调用正确的 create_widget 参数。同时创建 button widget，widget_type 为 \"button\"，绑定到 CMD_START。\n\n但需要注意的是，button 可能不是标准 widget_type。工具定义中没有列出可用的 widget_type，但应该有 \"button\"。我将尝试使用 \"button\"。如果失败，再调整。\n\n我需要先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。在回复中说明。然后调用 create_widget 创建两个 widget。由于两个创建是独立的，可以在同一个回复中调用两次 manage_pages。但每次只能调用一个工具？我可以连续调用两次，但需要在同一回复中。让我先切换阶段。"}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6947, "output_tokens": 409, "latency_ms": 11079.387299978407, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户需要创建两个widget：一个tank绑定到TI-201，一个start button绑定到CMD_START。当前处于MANAGE_PAGES阶段，可用工具是manage_pages。我需要调用create_widget两次，一次创建tank，一次创建button。\n\n首先，我需要确认正确的参数格式。从之前的错误信息看，需要widget_id、type、position等字段。position应该是数组格式的tuple，比如[100, 100]。另外，还需要page_id，应该是\"chem_screen\"。\n\n对于tank widget：widget_id可以是\"tank1\"，type应该是\"tank\"，title可以是\"Tank\"，position可以是[100, 100]，expected_binding_types应该是{\"value\": [\"TI-201\"]}。\n\n对于button widget：widget_id可以是\"start_button\"，type应该是\"button\"，title可以是\"Start\"，position可以是[300, 100]，expected_binding_types应该是{\"command\": [\"CMD_START\"]}。\n\n但我不确定\"type\"字段的具体值，从错误信息看需要\"type\"字段。可能widget_type字段叫\"type\"？之前的错误信息提到\"create_widget.type: Field required\"，所以参数应该是\"type\"而不是\"widget_type\"。我需要调整参数名。\n\n让我先创建tank widget。使用manage_pages的create_widget动作，参数包括：action, page_id, widget_id, type, title, position, expected_binding_types。现在尝试。"}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7434, "output_tokens": 350, "latency_ms": 7600.1316999900155, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**\n\n我需要创建两个 widget：一个 tank 绑定到 TI-201，一个 start button 绑定到 CMD_START。\n\n让我先创建 tank widget：", "reasoning": "用户需要创建一个 tank 绑定到 TI-201 和一个 start button。我之前尝试在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段创建 widget，但遇到了 schema 错误，因为需要 size 字段。现在系统又回到了 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段。我需要再次切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，并在创建 widget 时提供正确的参数，包括 size。\n\n让我先切换回 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，然后尝试创建 widget。需要提供 page_id, widget_id, type, title, position, size, expected_binding_types。size 应该是数组 [width, height]。使用合理的默认值。先创建 tank widget，再创建 button widget。\n\n另外，start button 可能需要绑定到一个数字点位。之前看到有一个 CMD_START 点位，类型是 digital。expected_binding_types 应该是 {\"command\": [\"CMD_START\"]} 或类似的。\n\n现在开始。"}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9800, "output_tokens": 607, "latency_ms": 13354.855699988548, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**\n\n让我尝试创建一个基础的 tank widget。我将提供所有必需参数：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to add a tank bound to TI-201 and a button for start on the chemical screen. I'm currently in the CONFIG_ALARM stage, but I need to create widgets which should be done in MANAGE_PAGES. Let me switch to MANAGE_PAGES first. Then I need to call manage_pages with create_widget action.\n\nThe error messages I've been getting indicate schema errors. Looking back at the tool definition for manage_pages create_widget:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"create_widget\",\n  \"page_id\": string,\n  \"widget_id\": string, \n  \"type\": string,\n  \"position\": [x, y],\n  \"size\": [w, h]\n}\n```\n\nBut the error says \"create_widget.size: Field required\". I'm providing size as an array [200, 300]. Maybe the issue is with the position format? It says position should be a \"valid tuple\" - maybe it needs to be a tuple in JSON? But JSON doesn't have tuples, just arrays. Or maybe I need to use the correct parameter name? Let me check the tool definition again.\n\nThe tool definition shows:\n- \"position\": {\"maxItems\": 2, \"minItems\": 2, \"prefixItems\": [{\"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"type\": \"integer\"}], \"title\": \"Position\", \"type\": \"array\"}\n- \"size\": {\"maxItems\": 2, \"minItems\": 2, \"prefixItems\": [{\"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"type\": \"integer\"}], \"title\": \"Size\", \"type\": \"array\"}\n\nSo both position and size should be arrays of 2 integers. I've been using [100, 100] and [200, 300] which should be correct.\n\nMaybe the issue is that the tool expects JSON objects? Or maybe I need to provide style or expected_binding_types? Let me try with a simpler call first - just create a basic widget without binding types.\n\nActually, wait - I just realized something. The error message says \"create_widget.size: Field required\" even though I'm providing size. Maybe the system isn't receiving my parameters correctly? Or maybe there's a different issue?\n\nLet me try a different approach. Let me switch to MANAGE_PAGES and try to create a widget with minimal parameters. First, let me switch states."}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10489, "output_tokens": 383, "latency_ms": 9112.096199998632, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**", "reasoning": "我处于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，但用户想要创建 tank 和 button。我需要先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段。从工具定义看，manage_pages 当前允许 actions: create_widget, create_page。所以应该可以创建 widget。但之前调用 create_widget 时报错说 \"size: Field required\"，但我明明提供了 size。可能是格式问题？工具定义里 size 的 JSON Schema 是 \"size\": {\"maxItems\": 2, \"minItems\": 2, \"prefixItems\": [{\"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"type\": \"integer\"}], \"title\": \"Size\", \"type\": \"array\"}。我需要提供 size 数组。也许需要显式地提供 \"size\": [200, 300] 这样的数组。但错误信息显示没有收到 size？让我检查工具调用格式：我用了 \"size\": \"[200, 300]\"？不对，我用了 \"size\": [200, 300]，这是正确的。也许工具期望 size 是字符串？但 schema 说是数组。可能是工具实现有问题。让我尝试用 JSON 字符串？不，应该就是数组。也许需要提供 style 参数？但 style 是可选的。让我再试一次，确保格式正确。这次我用明确的 JSON 对象。先切换到 MANAGE_PAGES。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ChemicalProductionScreen"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 67040, "output_tokens": 6529, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 154138.8865999761}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "1b3c4850-011b-41a8-a2f9-7303437c8b8e", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f3599e6ce1c4114f7b734bd09c7cbd978a1dff38881dc1132eaa887bc698f83d", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-016", "text": "在chemical screen加个tank，绑到TI-201上，另外加个button用于start", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-18T01:24:25.919Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-18T01:25:21.734Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:24:25.919Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:24:28.652Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:24:28.652Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:24:45.792Z"}, {"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:24:45.792Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:25:06.850Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:25:06.850Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:25:21.734Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:25:21.734Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:25:21.734Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "create_page", "list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "chem_screen", "name": "chemical screen"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8326999959535897, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1298, "output_tokens": 101, "latency_ms": 2730.8453999867197, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查一下当前已有的页面，确认 chemical screen 的页面 ID。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Add a tank widget on the \"chemical screen\" page, bound to point TI-201\n2. Add a button widget for \"start\"\n\nFirst, I need to find the page ID for the \"chemical screen\". Let me list the pages first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2060, "output_tokens": 780, "latency_ms": 17135.696299985284, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，页面 `chem_screen`（chemical screen）已确认。\n\n不过，我需要跟您说明当前情况：\n\n**当前阶段限制：**\n\n在 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 阶段，我可用的工具仅限于基础图元操作：\n- ✅ 创建文本标签（create_text）\n- ✅ 画线条（create_line）\n- ✅ 分组/样式/流式布局\n\n而您的需求涉及：\n1. **创建 Tank 控件** — 这不是基础图元，属于 HMI 控件，当前阶段工具不支持创建\n2. **创建 Button 控件** — 同样属于 HMI 控件\n3. **绑定点位 TI-201** — 需要切换到 **BIND_POINTS** 阶段\n\n---\n\n**建议方案：**\n\n当前阶段我无法直接完成您全部的需求。我建议先切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段来创建 Tank 和 Button 控件，然后再进入 **BIND_POINTS** 阶段完成点位绑定。\n\n如果您希望我继续，请回复确认，我将切换到下一阶段来完成配置。\n\n或者，如果您只需要我先在 **chemical screen** 上做一些基础布局准备工作（比如画管道线、添加文字标注等），我可以用当前工具先完成。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "The user wants me to:\n1. Add a tank widget on the \"chemical screen\" page, bound to point TI-201\n2. Add a button widget for \"start\"\n\nI found the page ID is \"chem_screen\". Now I'm in the GENERATE_LAYOUT phase with these available tools:\n- create_text\n- create_line\n- group_widgets\n- set_widget_style\n- apply_flow_layout\n\nThe problem is: I don't have tools to create a \"tank\" widget or a \"button\" widget. These are more complex HMI widgets, not graphical primitives. The current tools only allow creating text labels, lines, grouping, styling, and flow layout.\n\nAlso, binding a widget to a point (TI-201) would require the point↔widget binding capability which is in manage_pages but the only allowed action is \"list_pages\" currently.\n\nSo my current tools are insufficient for:\n1. Creating a tank widget (not a primitive)\n2. Creating a button widget (not a primitive)\n3. Binding to point TI-201 (requires BIND_POINTS phase)\n\nI should let the user know that the current phase's tools are limited to graphical primitives and cannot create tank/button widgets. I should suggest switching to a different phase or explain what's needed.\n\nActually, let me re-read the context. The allowed actions for manage_pages is only \"list_pages\" in this phase. For manage_graphics, I can only create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout.\n\nI cannot create a tank or button widget with these tools. I should inform the user that:\n1. In the current GENERATE_LAYOUT phase, I can only create basic graphical primitives (text, lines)\n2. Creating tank/button widgets and binding to points requires different capabilities\n\nI should suggest switching to the next appropriate phase. Looking at the available next states: BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nMaybe MANAGE_PAGES could help with widget management? But the only allowed action is list_pages currently.\n\nI think I need to be honest with the user that the current tools cannot create tank/button widgets. \n\nThe existing tools are limited to basic graphical primitives and text elements. Creating tank and button widgets requires access to widget creation capabilities that aren't available in this phase, and binding to points needs the BIND_POINTS phase. I should explain these constraints and recommend transitioning to a phase that supports widget creation and point binding."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2875, "output_tokens": 621, "latency_ms": 21054.97500000638, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我现在处于 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段。让我查看一下当前可用的工具能力。\n\n经过确认，当前阶段中 `manage_pages` 工具仅支持 **list_pages**（查询页面列表）操作，**暂不支持**：\n\n- ❌ 创建 Tank 控件\n- ❌ 创建 Button 控件\n- ❌ 绑定点位 TI-201\n\n---\n\n**这意味着：** 当前工具集中缺少创建 HMI 控件（如 Tank、Button）的功能，无法直接完成您的需求。\n\n**您可以通过以下方式继续：**\n\n1. **手动创建控件** — 在 SCADA 编辑器中手动添加 Tank 和 Button 控件到 `chem_screen` 页面\n2. **如果系统支持** — 可能需要扩展 `manage_pages` 工具，增加类似 `create_widget` 或 `bind_point` 的 action\n\n如果您希望我在现有工具范围内做一些**辅助工作**，例如：\n- 用 `create_text` 在页面上放置标题/标注文字（如\"TI-201 储罐\"、\"启动\"）\n- 用 `create_line` 画管道连接线\n- 用 `set_widget_style` 给已有控件设置样式\n\n请告诉我，我可以立即帮您完成这些。\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "The user has confirmed moving to MANAGE_PAGES stage. Let me check what tools are available now.\n\nLooking at the current available tools:\n- manage_graphics: create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout\n- manage_pages: list_pages\n\nUnfortunately, even in the MANAGE_PAGES stage, the only action available for manage_pages is \"list_pages\". There are no actions to create widgets (like tank or button) or bind points.\n\nI don't have a tool to create tank widgets or button widgets. The manage_pages tool only allows list_pages action.\n\nI need to be honest with the user - the available tools in this stage still don't support creating HMI widgets (tank, button) or binding points. The system seems to have limited tooling available for this stage.\n\nLet me think about what I can do with the available tools:\n1. I could create text labels as placeholders\n2. I could draw lines for visual layout\n3. But I cannot create actual tank or button widgets\n\nI should inform the user that the current toolset doesn't include widget creation capabilities, and suggest what might be needed or offer alternatives within the current constraints.\n\nActually, let me re-read the tool descriptions more carefully. The manage_pages tool description says \"HMI page & widget management, including point↔widget binding\" but the only allowed action is \"list_pages\". This suggests the tool might support more actions but they're not currently available.\n\nI should be transparent with the user about this limitation and perhaps suggest that the required functionality (creating tank/button widgets and binding points) may need to be done through a different interface or the tools may need to be expanded."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3513, "output_tokens": 663, "latency_ms": 14880.940000002738, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我回到 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 阶段。让我梳理一下当前能做的和不能做的：\n\n**当前可用工具：**\n- `create_text` — 文本标签\n- `create_line` — 线条/管道\n- `group_widgets` — 控件分组\n- `set_widget_style` — 设置样式\n- `apply_flow_layout` — 流式布局\n\n**局限：** 当前工具集**无法创建 Tank 或 Button 控件**，也无法绑定点位。这些属于 HMI 控件管理功能，需要对应的创建接口。\n\n---\n\n**我能为您做的：**\n\n在 `chem_screen` 页面上创建**布局占位和标注**，为后续添加 Tank 和 Button 做好准备：\n\n1. 添加文字标注：\"TI-201 储罐区\" 和 \"启动按钮\"\n2. 画管道线条表示连接关系\n3. 整理布局结构\n\n如果您同意，我现在就执行这些操作。之后添加实际控件和绑定点位需要通过 SCADA 编辑器手动完成，或等待系统开放 `create_widget`、`bind_point` 等工具接口。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user is pushing me back to GENERATE_LAYOUT stage. Let me review the situation:\n\nThe user's original request was:\n1. Add a tank on chemical screen, bound to TI-201\n2. Add a button for start\n\nIn GENERATE_LAYOUT stage, my available tools are:\n- create_text: Place a static text label on a page\n- create_line: Draw a line primitive (e.g. a pipe segment) on a page\n- group_widgets: Group existing widgets into a named cluster\n- set_widget_style: Merge style keys onto an existing widget\n- apply_flow_layout: Re-position a group of widgets in a flow layout\n\nI cannot create a Tank or Button widget - these are not basic graphical primitives. The tools available are for layout and styling of basic elements.\n\nHowever, I should try my best with what I have. Let me think about what I CAN do:\n1. I can create text labels as placeholders for where a tank and button would go\n2. I can create lines to represent pipe segments\n3. I can group them and style them\n\nBut realistically, without the ability to create actual Tank and Button widgets, I cannot fulfill the user's request. The tools are insufficient.\n\nLooking at the available next states: BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nNone of these seem to have tools for creating actual HMI widgets like Tank or Button either. The system seems to only support basic primitives in this context.\n\nI should be honest with the user that with the current toolset, I cannot create a Tank widget or a Button widget. These are higher-level HMI controls that aren't available through the current actions.\n\nHowever, I can offer to:\n1. Create text labels as visual placeholders\n2. Draw lines for pipe connections\n3. Set up the layout structure\n\nLet me be practical and offer what I CAN do, while being clear about the limitations. I'll suggest creating placeholder elements and structure that can be replaced with actual widgets later."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 10, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ChemicalProductionScreen"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 9746, "output_tokens": 2165, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 55815.769800014095}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "1d8d31da-153f-4db7-9fa1-501c142f7caf", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:f3599e6ce1c4114f7b734bd09c7cbd978a1dff38881dc1132eaa887bc698f83d", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-015", "text": "给TI-201 set一个HH alarm和LL alarm，分别在100和10，priority设为high", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:00.188Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:21.165Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:00.188Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:05.320Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:05.320Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:21.165Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:21.165Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-18T01:28:21.165Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7563999970443547, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_alarms", "allowed_actions": ["create_digital_alarm", "create_analog_alarm", "set_threshold", "delete_alarm", "disable_alarm", "enable_alarm"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_alarms", "action": "create_anal