tokens": 974, "output_tokens": 176, "latency_ms": 5129.240499984007, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先确认一下点位 TI-201 是否存在，以便为它配置报警。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure alarms for a point called \"TI-201\":\n- HH (High-High) alarm at value 100, priority = high\n- LL (Low-Low) alarm at value 10, priority = high\n\nCurrent stage is ANALYZE_INTENT, and the current workflow is AlarmConfig with step discover_points.\n\nI need to first check if the point \"TI-201\" exists. Let me list the points to verify this. The available tools allow me to list points.\n\nLet me call list_points to see what points are available and verify TI-201 exists."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2077, "output_tokens": 333, "latency_ms": 7521.895200014114, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 TI-201 已确认存在，是一个模拟量（analog）点位。现在为您创建 HH 和 LL 两个报警：", "reasoning": "The user wants to create two alarms for point TI-201:\n1. HH (High-High) alarm at 100, priority high\n2. LL (Low-Low) alarm at 10, priority high\n\nThe point TI-201 exists and is an analog point. I need to create two analog alarms:\n1. alarm_hh_ti201 with high_limit = 100, priority = high\n2. alarm_ll_ti201 with low_limit = 10, priority = high\n\nThese two calls are independent, so I can make them in the same function_calls block."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3455, "output_tokens": 343, "latency_ms": 8312.532100011595, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "TI-201 的报警配置已全部完成！以下是配置结果汇总：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监控点位 | 报警类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 | 状态 |\n|---------|---------|---------|------|--------|------|\n| alarm_hh_TI-201 | TI-201 | HH（高高限） | 100 | 🔴 high | ✅ 已创建 |\n| alarm_ll_TI-201 | TI-201 | LL（低低限） | 10 | 🔴 high | ✅ 已创建 |\n\n---\n\n**当前阶段 CONFIG_ALARM 任务已完成。** 您可以：\n\n1. 继续为其他点位配置更多报警\n2. 切换到下一阶段，例如：\n   - **BIND_POINTS** — 绑定点位\n   - **CONFIG_HISTORY** — 配置历史数据\n   - **CONFIG_SCRIPT** — 配置脚本\n   - **DEPLOY** — 部署项目\n\n请问接下来需要做什么？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user seems to be repeating 